    "text": "By WBRC Staff ,\n2 hours ago BIRMINGHAM, Ala. (WBRC) - A former Vestavia Hills spa owner was sentenced to a total of 30 years in prison. Levan Johnson was found guilty on 12 counts of first degree sexual abuse on Aug. 15. According to court records, each count represents a different victim. The 30-year sentence was... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
